 "_bGenerateTableOfContents": false,
 "_sText": "<h1>ENGINEER FIRST PERSON ANIMATION OVERHAUL V.4b + V.3.1</h1>V.4b<br><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/E2qkbzIqoag\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><br>V.3.1<br><b><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cn5v-3ZmhMQ\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></b><br><b><br>This is a cosmetic skin</b>&nbsp;that replaces the&nbsp;<b>Engineer's first person animations</b>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<b>new</b>&nbsp;ones I made. This in no way gives you any disadvantages or advantages. This works properly with both viewmodel fov 54 and viewmodel fov 70. It also works decently with minmode. Please don't go higher than 70!<br><br><b>Everything works on sv_pure 1 if you use <a href=\"//steamcommunity.com/groups/PaysusSkins#announcements/detail/289752338002823917\">this method</a>! (though sometimes its buggy and doesn't work for mac/linux to my knowledge</b><br><br><h1>Discord</h1>Donate if you'd like to support my nearly ten years of modding:&nbsp;<a class=\"yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string\" spellcheck=\"false\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=comments&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazFKM1BJbVAwdUdnR2NkR1JjVDVsRldwSlZLd3xBQ3Jtc0ttT1JvRHQyX0NLajFISmlZVmpHYngtemlOUHUzcHh5M3FFVnd1eXRjTnotblJhUmlpY3ptZmlrQWpkMmhOS3dFT2FPQ0g3Tmg2NGl4cVc5cy14RnZpSnBucnNlVmhtQlFoQTljeE9DMmZTM2ZES0Q3UQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fko-fi.com%2FPaysus&amp;stzid=Ugw_CCBFhLFrdrlZQAx4AaABAg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"auto\">https://ko-fi.com/Paysus</a>",
